    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/159a3a7a0b8e0d221a92ca19d56a5b34.avif?t=1755203324\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worms rule. Bugs rebel. Bug Alliance is a pixel-action RPG where you fight, evolve, and survive as insect warriors in brutal game modes. Farm resources, upgrade gear,  and crush tyrants in a war to reclaim your world!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > -------------*******-------------*******-------------*******-------------*******-------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the Earth faces the catastrophic meteor strike, everything changes once and for all. With the extinction of humanity, it leaves its place to a new mutated life. This &quot;New World&quot; is mainly ruled by two forms of living, Bugs, and Worms. Worms try to devour the nature to feed their greedy King - Glutton. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bugs, on the other hand, under the command of their Queens, pledged to protect the nature and the whole living from hoggish worms at any cost.  After losing the great battle, bugs and their queens are captured, tortured, and enslaved. Many years later, bugs create a secret alliance, called \u201cRequiem Society\u201d, with the mission to unite all of the brave and mighty Bug warriors across the continent and fight back for the Volucris and the Queens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------*******-------------*******-------------*******-------------*******------------- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/1874603af004629a66387f1df3ef6007.poster.avif?t=1755203324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/1874603af004629a66387f1df3ef6007.webm?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/1874603af004629a66387f1df3ef6007.mp4?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/82f2075028d5b362e4ba4e5ed37a0f08.poster.avif?t=1755203324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/82f2075028d5b362e4ba4e5ed37a0f08.webm?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/82f2075028d5b362e4ba4e5ed37a0f08.mp4?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug characters with unique abilities and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolution, proficiency and ascension system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich story and lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging maps</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon and Character upgrades</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges and achievements<br> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME MECHANICS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>ONSLAUGHT GAME MODE</u></strong>   <br>In this mode players have to outlast endless waves of swarming worms and fight for their lives. There are different maps with specific difficulties. Every 10th wave players encounter deadly bosses after which enemies become stronger. Also players collect essences while killing worms, which can be used to evolve characters later on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/6b54b8ffce95483203c860b88abf5c6e.poster.avif?t=1755203324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/6b54b8ffce95483203c860b88abf5c6e.webm?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/6b54b8ffce95483203c860b88abf5c6e.mp4?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/94cc10a6d8b0416381b5652185a56841.poster.avif?t=1755203324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/94cc10a6d8b0416381b5652185a56841.webm?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/94cc10a6d8b0416381b5652185a56841.mp4?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>RESISTANCE GAME MODE</u></strong> <br>Resistance presents Tower Defense like game experience, where players defend their mining station against relentless waves of enemy assaults, strategically deploying towers. Players will gather valuable resources while defending their station as long as possible. The more mining the better farming. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/4549a754c7d9cc3640802be0cb58427d.poster.avif?t=1755203324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/4549a754c7d9cc3640802be0cb58427d.webm?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/4549a754c7d9cc3640802be0cb58427d.mp4?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/34cb8e58ad0a6d26bf9c9498b4e2021f.poster.avif?t=1755203324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/34cb8e58ad0a6d26bf9c9498b4e2021f.webm?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/34cb8e58ad0a6d26bf9c9498b4e2021f.mp4?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>EXPEDITION GAME MODE (Coming Soon)</u></strong> <br>Expedition mode throws you into unpredictable, ever-changing battlegrounds where every room is a new challenge. Fight through enemy-infested zones, tackle unique objectives  and decide whether to risk pushing forward or stock up at the trader. With escalating difficulty and endless mode, every expedition is a thrilling test of skill, strategy, and endurance. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>EVOLUTION, PROFICIENCY AND ASCENSION</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can evolve their favorite bug character, as well as upgrading their arsenal (weapons and abilities). Collect essence and resources, evolve your bug, make it stronger and embark on harder levels. Meanwhile upgrade your weapons and abilities, make your bug warrior unstoppable. Reveal legendary skills of your bug warrior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/78aabfdac2f0260878eeb7f61e1c1128.poster.avif?t=1755203324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/78aabfdac2f0260878eeb7f61e1c1128.webm?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/78aabfdac2f0260878eeb7f61e1c1128.mp4?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/fe58938544a7d58f1bb8298ff961efed.poster.avif?t=1755203324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/fe58938544a7d58f1bb8298ff961efed.webm?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/fe58938544a7d58f1bb8298ff961efed.mp4?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHALLENGES &amp; ACHIEVEMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you eager for some hardcore? Then challenges are exactly for you! Complete tons of challenges and unlock new characters, maps, valuable resources and much more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/bde906265522115b2782467dfed84ec7.poster.avif?t=1755203324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/bde906265522115b2782467dfed84ec7.webm?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/bde906265522115b2782467dfed84ec7.mp4?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPCOMING FEATURES</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expedition game mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lore Book</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics and Power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New unique Bug characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New engaging maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End-game Features </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more to be decided together with our great community</p>",
