els. Meanwhile upgrade your weapons and abilities, make your bug warrior unstoppable. Reveal legendary skills of your bug warrior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/78aabfdac2f0260878eeb7f61e1c1128.poster.avif?t=1755203324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/78aabfdac2f0260878eeb7f61e1c1128.webm?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/78aabfdac2f0260878eeb7f61e1c1128.mp4?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/fe58938544a7d58f1bb8298ff961efed.poster.avif?t=1755203324\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/fe58938544a7d58f1bb8298ff961efed.webm?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018360/extras/fe58938544a7d58f1bb8298ff961efed.mp4?t=1755203324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHALLENGES &amp; ACHIEVEMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you eager for some hardcore? Then challenges are exactly for you! Complete tons of challenges and unlock new characters, maps, valuable resources and much more.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_